No repo tools exposed here, so I can’t inspect/edit files.

Likely root cause: unit mismatch, not `>`.

JWT `exp` is seconds. `Date.now()` is milliseconds. Fix:

```js
const currentTime = Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000);

if (currentTime > expiry) {
  reject();
}
```

If your product defines expiry boundary as valid, keep `>`. If using JWT spec, boundary is expired → use `>=`.
